{"title":"위대한 미친개 [19세 완전판]","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=v7J8P/dJMcadf00nG/s88W5JzgriudZDxgIV39IK&filename=th3","synopsis":"\"오랜만이네, 예쁜아?\"결혼을 앞둔 유주의 앞에 갑자기 나타난 그녀의 첫사랑, 도경.9년 만이었다. 스무 살에 헤어져, 스물아홉 살에 만난 그는 여전히 수려했고, 강했고,미친개였다.\"이것만 알아둬. 난 방금, 내가 가진 모든 걸 너의 파혼에 걸었다고.\"유주는 자신의 인생을 다시 망치러 온 도경을 밀어내보려고 하지만.도경은 이해할 수 없을 만큼 유주에게 절절했다.\"유주야. 너는 사랑하는 사람을 위해서 어디까지 할 수 있어?\"\"난 널 위해 미친개라도 될게, 기꺼이.\"","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":102,"change":{"type":"down","amount":18}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":96,"change":{"type":"up","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":106,"change":{"type":"down","amount":10}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":99,"change":{"type":"up","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":91,"change":{"type":"up","amount":8}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":103,"change":{"type":"down","amount":12}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":93,"change":{"type":"up","amount":10}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":101,"change":{"type":"down","amount":8}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":102,"change":{"type":"down","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":109,"change":{"type":"down","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":94,"change":{"type":"up","amount":15}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":110,"change":{"type":"down","amount":16}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":112,"change":{"type":"down","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":111,"change":{"type":"up","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":102,"change":{"type":"up","amount":9}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":101,"change":{"type":"up","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":104,"change":{"type":"down","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":110,"change":{"type":"down","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":110,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":82,"change":{"type":"up","amount":28}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":91,"change":{"type":"down","amount":9}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":103,"change":{"type":"down","amount":12}},{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":